<title>USA: Fla. Housing Agency $6.5 mln deal repriced.</title>
<headline>Fla. Housing Agency $6.5 mln deal repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Tuesday it repriced Florida Housing Finance Agency's $6.5 million revenue bond issue, adjusting the 2028 and 2036 maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>FLORIDA HOUSING FINANCE AGENCY</p>
<p>RE: $6,540,000*</p>
<p>HOUSING REVENUE BONDS, 1996 SERIES M</p>
<p>(VIZCAYA VILLAS PROJECT)</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD RECEIVED</p>
<p>NOTE REPRICING IN 2028 AND 2036.</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES OF DTC</p>
<p>SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>  MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA		   FITCH: AAA</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>  DATED: 09/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 12/01/1996</p>
<p>DUE: 12/01 &amp; 06/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p>MATURITY		 AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>12/01/1998		   30M    4.30  %</p>
<p>12/01/1999		   45M    4.50  %</p>
<p>12/01/2000		   55M    4.60  %</p>
<p>12/01/2001		   55M    4.75  %</p>
<p>12/01/2002		   60M    4.90  %</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>12/01/2003		   60M    5.05  %</p>
<p>12/01/2004		   65M    5.20  %</p>
<p>12/01/2005		   70M    5.30  %</p>
<p>12/01/2006		   75M    5.40  %</p>
<p>12/01/2007		   75M    5.50  %</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>12/01/2008		   85M    5.60  %</p>
<p>12/01/2009		   80M    5.70  %</p>
<p>12/01/2015		  640M    6.00  %</p>
<p>12/01/2021		  910M    6.125 %</p>
<p>12/01/2028		1,580M    6.20  %</p>
<p>06/01/2036		2,655M    6.25  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 06/01/2006    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 06/01/2008</p>
<p>FOR ADDITIONAL INFORMATION REGARDING THE EXTRAORDINARY</p>
<p>REDEMPTION PROVISIONS PLEASE REFER TO YOUR PRELIMINARY</p>
<p>OFFICIAL STATEMENT.</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, September 18, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on September 24, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Douglas James Securities Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
